# The API keys this app reads, by name, with no values. Each name here is
# also declared under app_secrets in manifest.yaml, and its value is set in
# Pippa: Apps > Created by me > your app > Keys. If you ever run the app on
# your computer, copy this file to .env and put the values there: git never
# commits .env. Never put a real key in this file: it is committed, and this
# repository is public.
#
# Both are optional. Without them the app uses OpenStreetMap and reports
# busyness as "unknown".
#
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
# BESTTIME_API_KEY=
